{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id512101688"}, "name":{"label":"Ggvhdd39"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-05-01T03:18:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"12606242785"}, "title":{"label":"Needs better photo detection"}, "content":{"label":"Love this app, highly recommend especially for apps like instagram and TikTok - situations where you simply want to ask yourself ‘do I really want to USE this app or am I just opening it by habit, boredom or weird sense of duty to do so. A good alternative to deleting it while still combating the addictive qualities and returning it to the reason you downloaded them in the first place: to connect with people. I still check Instagram every day, but only once for 10 mins and only to reply to messages and see stories and friends posts. IMPROVEMENT: The grass scanner should make sure that a hand is actually present in the photo (so you can’t just take a zoomed picture of grass and ensure that you actually touched it not just looked at it). Additionally, could also allow just the one grass tussock eg. growing between pavers.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=6739589530&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
